title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/viewer:save
catalog: GUI command
target: viewer:save
summary: Viewer: write the changes to the text file [force: even over a change made on disk]

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``viewer`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``ctrl+s`` → ``viewer:save`` (while ``viewer-text`` is focused, also in a text input)
* ``p s`` → ``viewer:save`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
